Package: bob-der
Version: @VERSION@
Section: devel
Priority: optional
Architecture: @ARCHITECTURE@
Maintainer: bob-der <bob-der@example.com>
Installed-Size: @INSTALLED_SIZE@
Depends: python3 (>= 3.10)
Recommends: bubblewrap, curl, ca-certificates
Suggests: ollama
Homepage: https://github.com/bobwdmai/bob-der
Description: autonomous Ollama coding agent for the terminal
 bob-der is a terminal coding agent with a Nemotron main model, a fixed
 gpt-oss subagent, Gemma vision support, live reasoning, read-only planning,
 copyable output, and tools for files, commands, Git, tests, and diagnostics.
 .
 Python dependencies are bundled so the package does not depend on a
 distribution-specific Textual package.
